    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d277">

                <pb facs="0361" n="343" sameAs="frus:frus1946v11/pg343"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.00/6–1446: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Bolivia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Adam</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-06-14T18:00:00-04:00">June 14, 1946—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 15—9:35 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>533. Jack Neathery<anchor n="11" xml:id="d277-f1"/> did unusually fine job this
                    morning on Panagra matter. He succeeded in
                    getting guarantees from responsible quarters that planes would not be bothered,
                    permission to use their communication system and the passengers’ bus back.</p>
                <p>Planes have now landed and there is no reason to expect further difficulties. Sum
                    total trouble caused Panagra by revolution
                    was one plane rerouted via Antofagasta to Salta.</p>
                <p>Paz Estenssoro<anchor n="12" xml:id="d277-f2"/> told Neathery, Grace and Company
                    was a haven of anti-Government people and he was contemplating a protest to US
                    Government. I assisted Ernesto Aranibar<anchor n="13" xml:id="d277-f3"/> to
                    escape to Brazilian Embassy this morning and he is of opinion American citizen
                    manager for Grace is essential. I agree.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adam</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d277-f1" n="11" xml:id="d277-f1-content">
                <p>United States Commercial Attaché.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d277-f2" n="12" xml:id="d277-f2-content">
                <p>Victor Paz Estenssoro, Bolivian Minister of Finance and Chief of the M.N.R.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d277-f3" n="13" xml:id="d277-f3-content">
                <p>General Manager of Pan American Grace Airways in
                    Bolivia.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
